{{!-- Shown when the OAuth2 application is set to "Accept only Google Workspace accounts" and the account
that signed in is a personal one; offers a link to restart the setup. Sibling of
account-identity-error.hbs and oauth-scope-error.hbs - the user made a correctable choice, so the flow
stops here with a way back rather than bouncing them to the calling application. --}}

<div class="ee-center">
    <h1>{{_ "Work Account Required" templateLocale}}</h1>
</div>

<div class="ee-alert ee-alert-error">
    <span class="ee-icon ee-icon-alert-triangle ee-icon-lg"></span>
    <span>{{_ "This setup accepts only a Google Workspace account, and a personal Google account was used." templateLocale}}</span>
</div>

{{#if actualEmail}}
<dl class="ee-dl">
    <dt>{{_ "Account used" templateLocale}}</dt>
    <dd>{{actualEmail}}</dd>
</dl>
{{/if}}

<p class="ee-muted">
    {{_ "Try again and sign in with your work or school account. If you believe this is a mistake, contact the service that sent you this link." templateLocale}}
</p>

<div class="ee-form-actions">
    <a href="{{retryUrl}}" class="ee-btn ee-btn-primary ee-btn-block">
        <span class="ee-icon ee-icon-refresh"></span>{{_ "Try Again" templateLocale}}
    </a>
</div>
